---
import { domains, pathSteps, reviewCards } from '../data/garden';
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<div class="dashboard">
  <div class="dashboard-top"><span class="eyebrow">HAIJIANG’S LEARNING LAB</span><a href="/paths/first-project/">我的学习路线</a></div>
  <section class="intro-grid" aria-labelledby="_top">
    <div class="intro-copy">
      <div class="small-label"><span class="leaf-mark"></span> 持续学习 · 独立思考 · 动手创造</div>
      <h1 id="_top" data-page-title>让学到的知识，<br/>成为走向世界的<span>能力。</span></h1>
      <p>以 AI 与安全为主线，在真实场景中练习英语、思考与表达。<br class="desktop-break"/>把每一次理解，变成可以展示的作品。</p>
      <div class="hero-actions"><a class="lab-button primary" href="/paths/first-project/">开始第一条学习路径</a><a class="lab-button quiet" href="#learning-map">探索学习地图</a></div>
      <div class="intro-foot"><Icon name="book" size={17}/> 学习有路径，实践有成果，成长有记录。</div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-visual">
      <div class="visual-caption"><span>THE LEARNING LOOP</span><span>理解与行动之间</span></div>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 460 300" role="img" aria-labelledby="loop-title loop-desc">
        <title id="loop-title">学习循环：理解、实践、表达、复盘</title><desc id="loop-desc">一本打开的书连接四个能力节点，代表通过理解、实践、表达和复盘，把知识转化为能力。</desc>
        <defs><pattern id="dots" width="20" height="20" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><circle cx="2" cy="2" r="1" fill="currentColor" opacity=".13"/></pattern></defs>
        <rect width="460" height="300" fill="url(#dots)"/>
        <ellipse cx="230" cy="154" rx="150" ry="102" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" opacity=".22" stroke-dasharray="5 7"/>
        <path d="M125 97 198 138M267 138l70-41M126 219l76-45m63 0 71 45" stroke="currentColor" opacity=".25" stroke-width="2"/>
        <g class="book-drawing"><path d="M228 133c-28-15-56-15-77-4v68c25-10 50-7 77 7 27-14 52-17 77-7v-68c-21-11-49-11-77 4Z" fill="var(--lab-surface)" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M228 134v69m-60-61c14-3 28-1 43 5m-43 9c14-3 28-1 43 5m-43 9c14-3 28-1 43 5m33-28c15-6 29-8 43-5m-43 19c15-6 29-8 43-5m-43 19c15-6 29-8 43-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/></g>
        <g class="diagram-node"><rect x="59" y="54" width="116" height="48" rx="14"/><text x="117" y="83" text-anchor="middle">理解 Understand</text></g>
        <g class="diagram-node"><rect x="290" y="54" width="116" height="48" rx="14"/><text x="348" y="83" text-anchor="middle">实践 Build</text></g>
        <g class="diagram-node"><rect x="59" y="219" width="116" height="48" rx="14"/><text x="117" y="248" text-anchor="middle">复盘 Reflect</text></g>
        <g class="diagram-node"><rect x="290" y="219" width="116" height="48" rx="14"/><text x="348" y="248" text-anchor="middle">表达 Explain</text></g>
        <path d="m231 67 3-12 3 12 12 3-12 3-3 12-3-12-12-3 12-3Z" fill="var(--lab-accent)"/>
      </svg>
      <div class="visual-note"><span class="tiny-chip">AI × SECURITY</span><span>把知识连接起来，也把世界打开。</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="workbench-grid">
    <section class="focus-panel" aria-labelledby="focus-title">
      <div class="panel-kicker"><span class="eyebrow">CURRENT FOCUS</span><span class="outline-chip">入门实践 · 4 个步骤</span></div>
      <h2 id="focus-title">给 AI 智能体，画一道权限边界。</h2>
      <p>从一次 HTTP 请求开始，理解工具调用风险，用英语解释方案，最后完成一个小实验。</p>
      <div class="path-preview">{pathSteps.map((step, index) => <a href={step.href} data-step-indicator={step.id}><span class="step-number">{index + 1}</span><span>{step.title}</span></a>)}</div>
      <div class="focus-bottom"><a href="/paths/first-project/">查看完整路径</a><span data-path-progress>0 / 4 步骤已完成</span></div>
    </section>
    <section class="review-panel" aria-labelledby="daily-title">
      <div class="panel-kicker"><span class="eyebrow">A LITTLE, EVERY DAY</span><Icon name="clock" size={20}/></div>
      <h2 id="daily-title">给记忆一点回声。</h2>
      <p>先尝试回忆，再揭晓答案。今天记住的表达，下次真正用出来。</p>
      <div class="review-count"><strong data-due-count>{reviewCards.length}</strong><span>张卡片等待复习</span></div>
      <a class="lab-button secondary" href="/review/">进入复习卡片</a>
      <small>进度保存在当前浏览器，可导出备份。</small>
    </section>
  </div>

  <section id="learning-map" aria-labelledby="map-title">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">YOUR LEARNING MAP</span><h2 id="map-title">六个领域，一条成长主线。</h2></div><span class="section-note">专业能力 × 国际表达 × 独立生活</span></div>
    <div class="domain-grid">{domains.map(domain => <a class={`domain-card ${domain.color}`} href={domain.href}><div class="domain-top"><span class="domain-icon"><Icon name={domain.icon}/></span><span class="domain-en">{domain.en}</span></div><h3>{domain.label}</h3><p>{domain.description}</p><div class="domain-topics">{domain.topics}</div></a>)}</div>
  </section>

  <section class="featured-section" aria-labelledby="featured-title">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><span class="eyebrow">LEARN IT. MAKE IT YOURS.</span><h2 id="featured-title">从一个具体场景开始。</h2></div><a href="/projects/tool-guard/">进入项目实验室</a></div>
    <div class="featured-grid"><a class="featured-card" href="/english/security-standup/"><span class="feature-art conversation-art"><span class="speech-bubble">Could you clarify…?</span><span class="speech-bubble reply">Let’s check the policy.</span><span class="art-caption">SCENE 01 · TEAM STAND-UP</span></span><div class="featured-body"><span class="eyebrow">图解英语 · 职场沟通</span><h3>在晨会上，解释一次安全告警</h3><p>看图理解场景，拆解词族，再用自己的话复述。</p><span class="text-link">开始场景练习</span></div></a><a class="featured-card" href="/security/tool-boundaries/"><span class="feature-art boundary-art"><span class="boundary-label">AGENT</span><span class="boundary-gate">POLICY GATE</span><span class="boundary-label">TOOL</span><span class="art-caption">TRUST IS A BOUNDARY, NOT A PROMPT.</span></span><div class="featured-body"><span class="eyebrow">AI 安全 · 原理图解</span><h3>模型能提出建议，谁来批准执行？</h3><p>沿着数据流，找到真正需要做授权检查的位置。</p><span class="text-link">理解信任边界</span></div></a></div>
  </section>
  <footer class="lab-footer"><span>海江的学习实验室 · 保持好奇，持续构建。</span><a href="/about/">关于这里与使用方法</a><span>Built with Astro & Starlight</span></footer>
</div>
<script>
  import { readProgress, dueCards } from '../lib/progress.mjs';
  import { reviewCards, pathSteps } from '../data/garden';
  function updateDashboard() {
    const progress = readProgress();
    const count = pathSteps.filter(s => progress.completed.includes(s.id)).length;
    const label = document.querySelector('[data-path-progress]');
    if (label) label.textContent = `${count} / ${pathSteps.length} 步骤已完成`;
    document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-step-indicator]').forEach(el => el.classList.toggle('is-complete', progress.completed.includes(el.dataset.stepIndicator!)));
    const due = document.querySelector('[data-due-count]');
    if (due) due.textContent = String(dueCards(progress, reviewCards).length);
  }
  updateDashboard();
  window.addEventListener('pageshow', updateDashboard);
</script>
